    "Her martyrdom, and the king's subsequent affliction and healing through Gregory the Illuminator, catalyzed the conversion of Armenia to Christianity. Hripsime is venerated as a foundational martyr of the Armenian Church, with a historic church built over her traditional burial site in Vagharshapat near Echmiadzin."
